 <name>Log</name>
 <channel>pear.php.net</channel>
 <summary>Logging Framework</summary>
 <description>The Log package provides an abstracted logging framework.  It includes output handlers for log files, databases, syslog, email, Firebug, and the console.  It also provides composite and subject-observer logging mechanisms.</description>
